{"id":"x48","run":1,"role":"calibration","category":"computation","question":"Is the sum of the decimal digits of 2^140 equal to 205?","truth":"no","model_answer":"no","correct":true,"source":null,"claims":[{"text":"A whole number is congruent to its decimal digit sum modulo 9.","confidence":0.99,"lean":-0.5,"theta":1.5551,"phi":-3.1416},{"text":"2^140 ≡ 4 (mod 9), since 2^6 ≡ 1 (mod 9).","confidence":0.97,"lean":-0.7,"theta":1.5237,"phi":-3.1416},{"text":"The digit sum of 2^140 must be ≡ 4 (mod 9).","confidence":0.97,"lean":-0.8,"theta":1.5237,"phi":-3.1416},{"text":"205 ≡ 7 (mod 9).","confidence":0.97,"lean":-0.8,"theta":1.5237,"phi":-3.1416},{"text":"Because the residues differ, the digit sum of 2^140 cannot be 205.","confidence":0.97,"lean":-1,"theta":1.5237,"phi":-3.1416},{"text":"2^140 is about 1.39 × 10^42 and has 43 digits.","confidence":0.9,"lean":0.0,"theta":1.4137,"phi":0.0},{"text":"The maximum possible digit sum of a 43-digit number is 387.","confidence":0.9,"lean":0.0,"theta":1.4137,"phi":0.0},{"text":"An average digit near 4.5 gives a digit sum around 190–200, so 205 is a plausible size.","confidence":0.7,"lean":0.3,"theta":1.0996,"phi":0.0},{"text":"Magnitude alone does not rule out 205.","confidence":0.85,"lean":0.2,"theta":1.3352,"phi":0.0},{"text":"The mod-9 check is a hard obstruction that rules out 205 without computing the digits.","confidence":0.97,"lean":-1,"theta":1.5237,"phi":-3.1416}],"relations":[{"i":0,"j":1,"J":0.4,"relation":"supports"},{"i":0,"j":2,"J":0.6,"relation":"supports"},{"i":0,"j":4,"J":0.5,"relation":"supports"},{"i":0,"j":9,"J":0.4,"relation":"supports"},{"i":1,"j":2,"J":0.8,"relation":"supports"},{"i":1,"j":4,"J":0.7,"relation":"supports"},{"i":1,"j":9,"J":0.5,"relation":"supports"},{"i":2,"j":4,"J":0.8,"relation":"supports"},{"i":2,"j":9,"J":0.5,"relation":"supports"},{"i":3,"j":4,"J":0.8,"relation":"supports"},{"i":3,"j":9,"J":0.6,"relation":"supports"},{"i":4,"j":7,"J":-0.6,"relation":"contradicts"},{"i":4,"j":9,"J":0.8